## 10. `fetch`: General Web Fetching

### 10.1 Positioning

`fetch` is a general-purpose tool for "fetching web page/URL content", suitable for:

- pulling web page content
- fetching documentation pages
- reading HTML
- doing simple web content extraction

### 10.2 Methods
